  "intentionalDeviations": "Bosak provider lifetime policy:output owns a private cloned tree exposed solely through nonmutating ProjectedNode wrappers. No mutable XObject escapes;Input.Native owns a separate snapshot and exports copies. Therefore output availability may check cancellation/revocation without serializing immutable tree. RequestInput still exposes XDocumentNode and retains its serialization/revocation guard. No Core check removed,no concurrent-use acceptance,no production/schema/native validation semantics changed.",
